      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We investigated the association between susceptible HLA and BMI change rate from diagnosis of diabetes to diagnosis of slowly progressive type 1 diabetes in Japanese diabetic patients. Subjects with the HLA DRB1*04:05-DQB1*04:01 haplotype were more likely to show weight loss than those without. This HLA haplotype might affect weight loss."
      },
